{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791468480, "covers_from": "2026-10-08T14:08:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-08T14:09:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791468540, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-08T14:08:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "queue_number": 59304, "sprite_key": "bear_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "其他", "content": "壯大空戰，陸戰拔樁，無限外溢，洋流淹沒滿全台。", "display_name": "中正代表 No.59,304", "mood": "positive", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-08T14:08:08+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 59305, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "交通", "content": "臺北車站轉乘計程車區域規劃很糟糕，不只本國人搞不清楚，對外國人更不友善。希望能有更好的排隊標示或方法", "display_name": "中正代表 Dennis", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-08T14:08:23+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 37419, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "大安路人行道拓寬很惱人，根本就不需要這麼大的人行道上下班時間轉敦化南路都會塞車", "display_name": "大安代表 No.37,419", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-08T14:08:35+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 51907, "sprite_key": "elephant_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "其他", "content": "沈寶貝，孩子的成長只有一次，威廉叫你要休息，一定要乖乖聽話，因為慧慧和麻糬仍然需要把拔的陪伴。", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.51,907", "mood": "positive", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-08T14:08:50+00:00", "duration_seconds": 10, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 10711, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "育兒", "content": "希望每個小孩子在台北市都能受到完善的保護", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.10,711", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 59305, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "display_name": "中正代表 Dennis", "district": "zhongzheng", "is_replay": false, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 37419, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.37,419", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"po